<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Level Up Complete! (Finally)</title>
    <style>
        /* Basic Reset for Mobile */
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            background-color: #ffe0f0; /* Light Pink Background */
            color: #333;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* Container for Mobile Centering */
        .container {
            max-width: 600px; /* Standard mobile width */
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px 15px;
        }

        /* Header Styling */
        header {
            background-color: #ff69b4; /* Hot Pink Header */
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 10px;
            border-bottom: 5px solid #ff1493;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 2.2em;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 1.1em;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* Section Styling */
        section {
            padding: 25px 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        section h2 {
            color: #ff69b4;
            font-size: 1.8em;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px dashed #ffb6c1;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        /* Wisdom List Styling */
        .wisdom-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .wisdom-list li {
            background-color: #fff0f5; /* Very Light Pink */
            margin: 10px 0;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 30px;
        }

        .wisdom-list li::before {
            content: '✅'; /* Checkmark icon */
            position: absolute;
            left: 5px;
        }

        /* Sincere Message Styling */
        .sincere-message {
            background-color: #ffb6c1; /* Light Salmon/Pink */
            color: #8b0000; /* Dark Red Text */
            padding: 30px;
            font-size: 1.4em;
            font-weight: bold;
            line-height: 1.4;
            border: 3px solid #ff1493;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 15px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #666;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>[GF's Name], Level Up Complete (Finally)</h1>
        <p>This is a mobile-optimized website because you're already obsessed with your phone.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">

        <section>
            <h2>Proof You're Getting Wiser</h2>
            <ul class="wisdom-list">
                <li>Has only complained about doing the dishes <strong>4</strong> times this week.</li>
                <li>Managed to not lose your keys <strong>2 days</strong> in a row.</li>
                <li>Now (mostly) knows the difference between a badger and a raccoon.</li>
                <li>Figured out that 'low battery' means "plug it in *now*."</li>
                <li>Successfully went **3 hours** without mentioning the dog/cat/pet.</li>
                <li>Finally, after all these years, achieved <strong>Max Level Cuddler</strong>.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="sincere-message">
            <p>Wait, No, Seriously...</p>
            <p>You are, without a doubt, the most incredible person I've ever met. Every year with you is an adventure I never want to end. Happy Birthday, my love. **Now go eat some cake.**</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Your Birthday Mission (The Final Level)</h2>
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x200/ff69b4/ffffff?text=FAKE+GIFT+BOX" alt="Placeholder for a funny gift box image" style="width: 150px; height: 150px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 10px 0;">
            <p style="font-size: 1.1em;">The box above contains your first hint. Open it and then follow the next instructions carefully...</p>
            <p style="font-weight: bold; color: #ff1493;">(Check your favorite spot in the living room for the *real* mission!)</p>
        </section>

    </div>

    <footer>
        Proudly Designed & Hosted by Your Adoring, Yet Sarcastic, Boyfriend.
        <br>
        © [Current Year] | All rights reserved (especially the sarcasm).
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
